# Earthen Ally counts only Allies "you control" (CR 105.2): with Earth Kingdom Protectors (white) it is a 2/2 on turn 1. Bot2's
# First-Time Flyer, a blue Ally, adds no blue (still 2/2). Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills the Protectors and the white goes with
# it: Earthen Ally is a 1/2 again (it is a green Ally itself).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Earthen Ally
Earth Kingdom Protectors
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
First-Time Flyer
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

